[OC][A Shaman]|cffffffffArathi Highlands: Call of Air|r  -  fly to Refuge Pointe (the flight path from chapter 19) and walk about 24 map units north-east to Veyric Thunderhame. Mobs on the way are level 30-33 (Highland Striders, Plains Creepers). Fozruk (42 elite), the Cresting Exiles (38-39) and Myzrael (44 elite) stand east of Veyric at about 63-68, 28-34 and Hammerfall (Horde, level 50 guards) lies further east: approach from the west and leave the way you came
[OC][A Hunter]|cffffffffWhile the shaman is in Arathi|r  -  Call of Air is a shaman errand: restock for the Kraul (see below) and wait at the harbour
[A Shaman] At [TAR352 Dungar Longdrink] on the gate ramp, |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Refuge Pointe]|r (a multi-hop flight, the game routes it) [G71.0,72.5 Stormwind City]
[A Shaman] At [TAR259023 Veyric Thunderhame], [QT94789] [QA96264 Elemental Aid] (Elemental Aid is 2,650 XP and ends here, but Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul drops the Tattered Note it needs: do it next chapter, hand in on a later Arathi visit) [G59.8,27.6 Arathi Highlands]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Two more at Veyric (not taken now):|r The Tempest's Weapons (96016) and Heed My Call (96135) are 3,150 XP each but level-40 quests built around the Eye of the Tempest, which the DB drops from the Ravaging Tempest at the quilboar ritual in Thousand Needles (36.7,39.3, Kalimdor; no level in the DB, treat 96135 as |cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r). Neither can be finished from this guide's route, so take them on the later visit when you hand in Elemental Aid, if you still want them. 96016 hands in at Bath'rah the Windwatcher on the south-east rim of the Alterac Mountains (80.5,66.9: a long trek with no road in the DB) and its choice includes Rage of the Storm (2H mace 35.6 dps, +15 Sta +12 Int, +10% Stormstrike, item level 40)
[OC][A Shaman] Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358) is also offered by Veyric: 20 twisted totems from four zones at level 36-41 (Badlands, Desolace, Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow). Not for this guide; its Horde copy (79361) starts at Bath'rah
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Go'Shek Farm:|r if you took Hints of a New Plague? (659) in Southshore, Quae stands 26 units south of Veyric and 14 east of Refuge Pointe, on the way back to the flight master. Hammerfall Grunts (34-35) and Peons mill around the farm and hate Alliance: stay on the road in Ghost Wolf. Quae then offers 658 (2,800 XP: a Sealed Folder from the Forsaken Courier, then 657, 660 and 661, which ends at Phin Odelic in Southshore); that is 30+ content, leave it
[O][A Shaman] At [TAR2712 Quae] at Go'Shek Farm, [QT659] (1,300 XP) [G60.2,53.9 Arathi Highlands]
[A Shaman] Walk west past Refuge Pointe to Stromgarde Keep and at [TAR2805 Deneb Walker] in the Alliance-held quarter, [V] buy Expert First Aid - Under Wraps (1g) and read it (First Aid 125, cap 225 - verified); take the Manual: Heavy Silk Bandage (22s) too if you want it at 180. Stay in the north-west quarter: the rest of the keep is Syndicate and Boulderfist ogres (Classic, unverified) [G27.0,58.8 Arathi Highlands]
